NOTE ON DATA AND AUDIO

This MIT licence covers the CODE in this repository only.

The datasets this project is built from, and the generated data bundles in
docs/*.js that derive from them, carry their own terms:

  * PHOIBLE 2.0 ....................... CC BY-SA 3.0
  * WikiPron .......................... CC BY-SA
  * Glottolog ......................... CC BY 4.0
  * Unicode CLDR ...................... Unicode licence
  * Natural Earth ..................... public domain
  * Audio (Wikimedia Commons) ......... mostly CC BY-SA 3.0; a few CC0,
                                        CC BY 3.0 US, and public domain

Because PHOIBLE and WikiPron are share-alike, reuse of the derived data in
docs/*.js is subject to those upstream terms, not to this licence.

Per-file audio attribution — author, uploader, licence, and Commons page for
every one of the 117 recordings — is in audio_manifest.csv. Full source
details and known limitations are on the About page of the site.
